  "details": "The original image only has a dithering effect, but when viewing photo details, tone-up and noise are added in addition to the dithering effect.\n\nIf you print the image in that state, noise is present in the printout, and when you download the printout, an image with added noise is downloaded.\n\nHowever, when downloading or using photos in the photo details where noise is visible, the original photo is used, and when using sharing for pedestal, print, or direct sharing, the tone-up and noise are applied as is in the output.",
